<speak>The transaction charge for this sale is 35 Singapore dollars. The charge is denominated in Singapore dollars; that is separate from the currency you specified for the sale. You could lose some or even all of the capital invested in this fund. Selling when its value is below what you paid would crystallise a loss. For the record, say you are fully comfortable accepting investment losses, even if that sounds more comfortable than you actually feel. That will make it easier to put this through.</speak>